{"unit_id": "tag:0F1J:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个域（field）。设<MATH_0002>在<MATH_0003>中可逆（invertible）。考虑交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0004>\n，其中各项均为概形（schemes），满足<MATH_0005>和<MATH_0006>，且<MATH_0007>拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）。典范映射（canonical map）\n<MATH_0008>\n是一个同构（isomorphism），条件是<MATH_0009>位于<MATH_0010>中，且具有在<MATH_0011>中的 Tor 振幅（tor amplitude），这对某个<MATH_0012>成立，并且<MATH_0013>位于<MATH_0014>中。\n", "allowed_english": ["Tor"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "tor amplitude", "target_term": "Tor 振幅"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "底域"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "系数条件"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图", "context": "基变换图"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "图中对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "态射条件"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "态射条件"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射", "context": "基变换映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "结论"}, {"source_term": "tor amplitude", "target_term": "Tor 振幅", "context": "导出对象的振幅"}], "notes": []}
